@host = https://localhost:7228

### Create a payment

### @name failure-create
POST {{host}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "merchant-1",
  "amount": 150.500
}
###
# @name create
POST {{host}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "merchant-1",
  "amount": 150.500,
  "currency": "kwd"
}

### Get missingit
GET {{host}}/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
### Get it
GET {{host}}/payments/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Capture it
POST {{host}}/payments/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/capture

### Capture it second time failure
POST {{host}}/payments/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/capture
###Refund it
POST {{host}}/payments/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/refund
### Refund already refunded payment failure
POST {{host}}/payments/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/refund
